                "message": "Fix compiler crash on a missing cimported module attribute inside a function\n\nType inference of a local assigned from a missing attribute of a\ncimported module read the entry of the error node, which is None.\nInfer error_type there, and report the error only once, from\nanalyse_types, instead of on every inference pass.\n\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/6009",
